# Project Vision Map

NovaStation is a long-term personal project developed as time, energy, and inspiration permit.

This document describes the intended evolution of the project and should not be interpreted as a development schedule or commitment to specific delivery dates.

NovaStation is under active architectural development. Periods of reduced activity or extended gaps between updates should not be interpreted as project abandonment. Development priorities may change over time as the project evolves.

